00:01:00.621 --> 00:01:02.114
There! See it now?

00:01:02.114 --> 00:01:03.060
Sadhu.

00:01:03.305 --> 00:01:04.194
Paying my respects.

00:01:04.544 --> 00:01:05.653
I'm paying my respect.

00:01:17.742 --> 00:01:18.927
[Atom] How do you act mad? [Faye] Right there!

00:01:19.729 --> 00:01:20.344
See?

00:01:21.725 --> 00:01:23.037
Look. What monk amulet is that?

00:01:25.004 --> 00:01:26.355
Sadhu.

00:01:36.214 --> 00:01:38.671
