00:02:40.756 --> 00:02:42.150
Beef, please.

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:45.490
Alright, bring it over as a prop.

00:02:45.490 --> 00:02:46.554
Bring the chicken as a prop.

00:02:46.952 --> 00:02:47.781
See?

00:02:49.368 --> 00:02:51.493
Hey, this is chicken. The beef's the other one.

00:02:51.493 --> 00:02:53.409
