00:26:33.021 --> 00:26:36.671
"Ooh-ee-ah~" (singing over Faye to censor it)

00:26:40.573 --> 00:26:41.424
Exactly.

00:26:41.627 --> 00:26:42.721
Good job.

00:26:42.794 --> 00:26:44.493
Very good, P'Faye.

00:26:44.926 --> 00:26:46.332
Can I say— "Ooh-ee-ah"?

00:26:46.332 --> 00:26:47.895
"Ooh-ee-ah~"

00:26:48.689 --> 00:26:51.465
Aww, I feel so bad for Pin.

00:27:04.053 --> 00:27:06.150
There are still men like this in the world…

00:27:07.483 --> 00:27:08.667
…why though?

00:27:09.366 --> 00:27:10.446
Seriously, why?

00:27:19.538 --> 00:27:21.588
Because I'm fabulous.

00:27:24.475 --> 00:27:25.927
Never forget to serve.

00:27:28.643 --> 00:27:29.744
This one?

00:27:30.123 --> 00:27:31.783
Serving from every angle.

00:27:41.370 --> 00:27:42.799
[Faye] Exactly. [Atom] This is cold war energy.

00:27:51.139 --> 00:27:52.884
Can you hand me my glasses?

00:27:53.107 --> 00:27:54.294
Does it hurt that much?

00:27:54.294 --> 00:27:55.912
Yeah, it really hurts.

00:27:59.622 --> 00:28:02.979
Losing my way is not so bad. Losing my heart to you is.

00:28:15.864 --> 00:28:18.585
You will see, Arisa. You will see.

00:28:18.585 --> 00:28:19.789
This time I'm not defending her.

00:28:20.887 --> 00:28:21.733
No, no.

00:28:22.698 --> 00:28:23.906
You will see.

00:28:25.372 --> 00:28:27.398
Lalin came running over without knowing anything.

00:28:34.836 --> 00:28:36.340
Oh my God.

00:28:39.166 --> 00:28:40.339
Is this a robbery or what?

00:28:42.360 --> 00:28:45.679
[Faye] Still can smile, huh? [Atom] Mom looks so smug right now.

00:28:52.761 --> 00:28:54.733
That's insanely generous.

00:29:05.995 --> 00:29:07.413
Did that hit deep?

00:29:07.625 --> 00:29:08.643
Absolutely.

00:29:17.785 --> 00:29:18.795
That really hit the spot.

00:29:19.417 --> 00:29:20.616
Really hit it.

00:29:22.095 --> 00:29:23.677
Oh—ow!

00:29:25.771 --> 00:29:30.243
Ouch, that hurts!

00:29:30.660 --> 00:29:32.540
Look at that! They're wearing traditional Thai outfits.

00:29:35.102 --> 00:29:35.903
So cute.

00:29:36.571 --> 00:29:37.897
I wanna wear Thai costumes too.

00:29:38.294 --> 00:29:39.798
Damn, that car looks fast.

00:29:39.798 --> 00:29:41.387
They're wearing Thai outfits and carrying lotus flowers.

00:29:41.752 --> 00:29:42.880
That's a Gen Z thing.

00:29:44.607 --> 00:29:45.661
We've done that.

00:29:48.244 --> 00:29:51.163
I've been carrying lotus flowers with my grandma since I was little.

00:29:51.391 --> 00:29:53.277
Ooh, flexing again.

00:29:54.336 --> 00:29:56.045
You just started carrying lotus flowers?

00:29:57.166 --> 00:29:58.359
Such a flex.

00:29:59.910 --> 00:30:02.489
Not only that, I can fold lotus petals too.

00:30:02.999 --> 00:30:04.293
There she goes flexing again.

00:30:04.945 --> 00:30:06.592
Why did you only just start?

00:30:07.745 --> 00:30:09.127
Because I just started.

00:30:09.457 --> 00:30:11.593
I'm following your lead.

00:30:11.593 --> 00:30:15.369
Knowing you do it since you were little made me wanna do it too.

00:30:24.432 --> 00:30:27.627
Pretty girl, pretty girl, pretty girl~

00:30:29.246 --> 00:30:31.110
But honestly, I didn't look that pretty there.

00:30:31.887 --> 00:30:33.315
I was lowkey terrified.

00:30:40.331 --> 00:30:42.173
The horse mask is cute though, isn't it?

00:30:42.173 --> 00:30:43.191
Mmm.

00:30:49.581 --> 00:30:50.944
Horses have ears.

00:30:51.117 --> 00:30:52.013
Wait.

00:30:52.634 --> 00:30:54.125
Of course horses have ears.

00:30:54.224 --> 00:30:55.811
Do their ears stand up?

00:30:56.050 --> 00:30:56.952
Or do they flop down?

00:30:57.070 --> 00:30:58.488
Oh wait—the ears stand up. - Like that!

00:30:58.488 --> 00:30:59.582
Right. - Their ears stand up.

00:30:59.790 --> 00:31:01.449
It's wearing a hat with upright ears.

00:31:03.190 --> 00:31:04.988
It even has glitter too, see?

00:31:04.988 --> 00:31:06.407
That horse is glam.

00:31:16.492 --> 00:31:17.768
You've got a lot of friends, huh?

00:31:17.768 --> 00:31:18.871
Obviously.

00:31:40.491 --> 00:31:41.205
Hm?

00:31:41.742 --> 00:31:42.468
What?

00:31:44.044 --> 00:31:44.544
What?

00:31:45.218 --> 00:31:46.507
"Looking better these days."

00:31:46.507 --> 00:31:47.138
See?

00:31:48.816 --> 00:31:49.972
When you're this pretty…

00:31:49.972 --> 00:31:51.318
Ooooh~

00:31:52.857 --> 00:31:55.258
That's for other people to say.

00:32:05.238 --> 00:32:07.797
No need to know. Don't worry about it.

00:32:08.281 --> 00:32:09.204
Why not!?

00:32:10.278 --> 00:32:11.300
Just a friend.

00:32:11.808 --> 00:32:13.067
A friend.

00:32:14.747 --> 00:32:15.497
Still going?

00:32:15.497 --> 00:32:16.965
You still haven't stopped asking?

00:32:18.020 --> 00:32:20.054
I wanna know everything.

00:32:20.896 --> 00:32:22.622
Then why was she hesitating?

00:32:23.949 --> 00:32:25.423
Because she changed her name.

00:32:25.796 --> 00:32:27.428
"Ooh-ee-ah~"

00:32:37.308 --> 00:32:38.671
He's everywhere, huh?

00:32:44.631 --> 00:32:48.654
Filming this scene was insanely… hot.

00:32:48.654 --> 00:32:49.154
Like...

00:32:49.154 --> 00:32:50.225
Mm.

00:32:50.359 --> 00:32:51.772
So hot that I thought I was gonna lose my mind.

00:33:08.108 --> 00:33:09.119
Beautiful.

00:33:12.991 --> 00:33:15.740
If we got any closer, you'd practically be sitting on me.

00:33:17.157 --> 00:33:19.892
Well, they literally said, "Could you two get a little closer?"

00:33:40.948 --> 00:33:42.074
Since when!?

00:33:42.616 --> 00:33:43.920
Wake me up when mom becomes supportive.

00:33:43.920 --> 00:33:44.757
When?

00:33:45.119 --> 00:33:46.748
'Very supportive'—when?

00:33:46.748 --> 00:33:47.833
Right now, apparently.

00:33:53.270 --> 00:33:55.087
Do you even live in the same house as your mom, sweetheart?

00:33:55.363 --> 00:33:56.742
Are you really living through the same thing?

00:33:58.477 --> 00:34:00.078
Are you even her real daughter at this point?

00:34:06.832 --> 00:34:08.099
Mom's intense.

00:34:15.685 --> 00:34:16.968
"Very supportive."

00:34:16.968 --> 00:34:17.736
See?

00:34:17.892 --> 00:34:20.437
"She's always been very supportive and never saw Alisa as an enemy."

00:34:20.437 --> 00:34:21.512
…Since when?!

00:34:24.458 --> 00:34:26.121
Here comes Team Arisa.

00:34:27.103 --> 00:34:28.344
Look.

00:34:53.809 --> 00:34:56.032
Auntie really loves Lalin...

00:34:56.032 --> 00:34:58.156
...because she reminds her of her younger brother.

00:35:15.147 --> 00:35:17.177
You can totally tell they like each other.

00:35:17.906 --> 00:35:19.046
"Support each other."

00:35:19.058 --> 00:35:20.066
"Very well."

00:35:25.075 --> 00:35:26.625
These two still haven't made a move yet.

00:35:26.966 --> 00:35:28.952
Is she secretly taking pictures every single move?

00:35:29.558 --> 00:35:30.716
Basically everywhere.

00:36:42.036 --> 00:36:43.561
She's confused as hell right now.

00:37:56.153 --> 00:37:57.310
And she's still smiling.

00:38:00.245 --> 00:38:03.203
She's been hurting. Why would you bring that up?

00:38:07.006 --> 00:38:08.819
Look at that sad puppy face.

00:38:11.636 --> 00:38:13.447
Aww...

00:38:23.829 --> 00:38:24.924
Exactly!

00:38:45.887 --> 00:38:47.454
Serving from every angle.

00:40:18.913 --> 00:40:19.908
No hesitation.

00:40:20.510 --> 00:40:21.133
None at all.

00:40:21.327 --> 00:40:22.592
Didn't even think twice.

00:41:06.979 --> 00:41:07.840
Still going?

00:41:19.333 --> 00:41:20.457
There it is.

00:41:32.138 --> 00:41:35.689
"Hands on hips, glaring daggers~" (singing)

00:42:50.870 --> 00:42:51.641
Uncle Mek!

00:42:52.112 --> 00:42:53.407
What cap is Uncle Mek wearing?

00:42:53.752 --> 00:42:54.913
Millions Max.

00:42:56.009 --> 00:42:57.733
Millions Max is sponsoring this.

00:42:57.854 --> 00:42:58.690
Product placement.

00:42:58.690 --> 00:42:59.913
Damn, good taste though.

00:43:04.204 --> 00:43:07.956
Honestly, Wit really does love Pin.

00:43:07.956 --> 00:43:11.397
But it's the kind of love that's possessive and controlling…

00:43:14.008 --> 00:43:15.723
It's the love that's…

00:43:18.723 --> 00:43:20.210
…too intense.

00:43:23.638 --> 00:43:25.149
And most importantly, he loves himself.

00:43:25.891 --> 00:43:26.677
A lot.

00:43:27.803 --> 00:43:32.072
Because if he truly loved his partner, he wouldn't hurt her like that.

00:44:43.394 --> 00:44:45.275
Ugh, I'm starting to get sleepy.

00:44:46.089 --> 00:44:47.462
Pinch. Awake now?

00:44:47.462 --> 00:44:49.341
I'm gonna fall asleep in the next part.

00:44:53.181 --> 00:44:54.033
Let me sleep first.

00:44:54.453 --> 00:44:55.930
Wake up right now.

00:45:02.269 --> 00:45:04.018
Watch it and react for me, okay?

00:45:04.018 --> 00:45:05.247
I'm asleep, then.

00:45:07.302 --> 00:45:09.238
Wake uppp!!!

00:45:14.687 --> 00:45:16.821
From that day until now…

00:45:17.577 --> 00:45:20.525
…I still haven't rewatched this part. I can't bring myself to watch it.

00:49:27.873 --> 00:49:29.542
Suddenly I'm sleepy.

00:49:44.058 --> 00:49:45.409
Uh... this zipper...

00:49:47.480 --> 00:49:49.107
Forgot to zip up...

00:50:09.976 --> 00:50:11.486
My heart's about to burst.

00:51:30.650 --> 00:51:31.877
Help!

00:51:36.507 --> 00:51:39.680
Even watching it now, I still end up holding my breath. I don't know why.

00:52:09.458 --> 00:52:11.172
Oh god…

00:52:11.693 --> 00:52:12.985
Oh god…

00:52:14.159 --> 00:52:16.117
Help meee. (in Isan dialect)

00:52:31.783 --> 00:52:33.100
During editing, they were like—

00:52:33.100 --> 00:52:36.081
"Turn the music down. Use the real breathing sounds."

00:53:21.878 --> 00:53:23.548
Check my pulse real quick.

00:53:26.395 --> 00:53:27.904
Wowww.

00:53:29.810 --> 00:53:31.706
That was straight-up mermaid energy just now.

00:53:35.421 --> 00:53:36.915
I can't. I can't.

00:54:19.275 --> 00:54:21.365
Back then, you actually grabbed my hair for real.

00:54:22.313 --> 00:54:24.587
Like, you really tugged on it.

00:54:26.776 --> 00:54:28.676
You grabbed it like this.

00:54:29.898 --> 00:54:31.850
My whole head moved.

00:54:31.936 --> 00:54:34.415
I honestly didn't realize I was pulling your hair.

00:54:34.415 --> 00:54:36.061
I'm sorry.

00:54:36.190 --> 00:54:38.616
I told you to raise your hand like...

00:54:38.890 --> 00:54:40.573
Like you were just holding my hair, right?

00:54:41.736 --> 00:54:43.300
At first you were holding it like this.

00:54:43.300 --> 00:54:45.311
Then you suddenly pulled like this.

00:54:46.979 --> 00:54:48.153
Did it hurt?

00:54:48.153 --> 00:54:50.002
So much...

00:55:00.901 --> 00:55:02.308
It's getting hot, huh?

00:55:04.223 --> 00:55:05.402
Weren't you cold at first?

00:55:05.402 --> 00:55:06.220
Not anymore.

00:55:38.033 --> 00:55:39.480
And that's the end of…

00:55:39.640 --> 00:55:41.162
EP...

00:55:41.359 --> 00:55:42.237
Five!

00:55:42.586 --> 00:55:43.665
Watching that was exhausting.

00:55:44.066 --> 00:55:45.773
'Cus I was holding my breath the whole last part.

00:55:45.773 --> 00:55:47.066
My heart still hasn't stopped racing yet.

00:55:47.487 --> 00:55:49.372
Well, it'd be weird if it stopped.

00:55:49.591 --> 00:55:51.115
It should keep beating.

00:55:51.738 --> 00:55:53.211
Which scene did you like?

00:55:53.648 --> 00:55:55.682
The scene I like...

00:55:56.523 --> 00:55:57.327
...is...

00:55:57.739 --> 00:55:59.386
...the charity event one, I guess.

00:56:01.250 --> 00:56:03.092
Why are you laughing!?

00:56:03.817 --> 00:56:05.844
I liked the charity event scene because...

00:56:05.844 --> 00:56:07.695
Okay, okay, the charity event.

00:56:07.868 --> 00:56:09.573
I'm not saying anything.

00:56:09.854 --> 00:56:11.207
Mm. That's it.

00:56:11.943 --> 00:56:12.843
But for me...

00:56:13.566 --> 00:56:14.416
...I like...

00:56:14.972 --> 00:56:16.054
...the love scene.

00:56:16.277 --> 00:56:18.530
The love scene was just…

00:56:19.112 --> 00:56:20.811
...visually devine.

00:56:20.811 --> 00:56:23.237
It truly conveyed the love...

00:56:24.518 --> 00:56:27.403
...the longing and all emotions.

00:56:27.403 --> 00:56:31.134
I would say it was perfect that day.

00:56:31.333 --> 00:56:33.813
And I felt like we were really well-protected.

00:56:34.139 --> 00:56:35.895
We were wearing two layers underneath.

00:56:35.895 --> 00:56:37.009
We didn't actually take our clothes off.

00:56:37.009 --> 00:56:37.968
There was only this much showing.

00:56:38.190 --> 00:56:39.082
Just this much.

00:56:40.450 --> 00:56:40.986
Honestly.

00:56:40.986 --> 00:56:41.789
Indeed.

00:56:42.595 --> 00:56:44.181
And everything just…

00:56:44.583 --> 00:56:45.779
...ran smoothly.

00:56:46.052 --> 00:56:47.208
Exactly.

00:56:47.354 --> 00:56:50.136
That day, after we finished filming that scene, I just felt…

00:56:50.380 --> 00:56:51.392
...really emotional.

00:56:51.392 --> 00:56:53.750
I know. It was like...

00:56:54.032 --> 00:56:56.252
Everyone in the monitor room…

00:56:56.990 --> 00:56:59.220
…and all the actresses and actors, too—

00:56:59.220 --> 00:57:00.990
seeing that visual just made us feel like…

00:57:02.193 --> 00:57:04.449
"Wow, this is so beautiful…"

00:57:04.675 --> 00:57:06.089
It just felt really good.

00:57:06.383 --> 00:57:08.011
And I really appreciated everyone involved.

00:57:08.588 --> 00:57:10.226
P' Faye was even crying.

00:57:10.402 --> 00:57:12.546
Yeah, because the visuals were genuinely so beautiful, you know?

00:57:12.546 --> 00:57:13.528
And it also felt like…

00:57:13.776 --> 00:57:16.344
…it took a long time to pull myself out of…

00:57:16.344 --> 00:57:19.588
…that scene emotionally.

00:57:19.588 --> 00:57:20.910
Like, it took about a week.

00:57:21.119 --> 00:57:22.941
By the time we got to the love scene…

00:57:22.941 --> 00:57:24.646
…the characters had already been through so much, you know?

00:57:24.646 --> 00:57:25.549
So it just felt like…

00:57:27.327 --> 00:57:28.155
*sigh*

00:57:28.155 --> 00:57:28.975
Like that.

00:57:29.101 --> 00:57:30.071
Yeah, so it just felt…

00:57:30.204 --> 00:57:31.839
And I'm really glad that fans talked about that scene…

00:57:31.839 --> 00:57:32.375
Yeah.

00:57:32.375 --> 00:57:38.396
And I'm really glad that fans talked about that scene…

00:57:38.396 --> 00:57:40.632
…and also in terms of the love itself.

00:57:40.632 --> 00:57:42.100
…and also in terms of the love itself.

00:57:42.240 --> 00:57:43.337
So it made me feel like…

00:57:43.468 --> 00:57:45.300
"Wow, this turned out really beautifully."

00:57:45.742 --> 00:57:48.228
As an actress, it makes all the exhaustion worth it.

00:57:49.788 --> 00:57:52.076
It's just so emotional… it makes you tear up.

00:57:52.632 --> 00:57:55.119
Before filming that scene, we also took a moment to…

00:57:55.583 --> 00:57:56.986
…hug each other…

00:57:56.986 --> 00:57:58.459
…and say things like…

00:57:58.694 --> 00:58:00.109
"If anything crosses your boundaries…

00:58:00.109 --> 00:58:02.166
…I'm sorry in advance," and stuff like that.

00:58:02.166 --> 00:58:04.732
We always respect each other while working together.

00:58:05.660 --> 00:58:06.965
Atom was honestly really...

00:58:06.965 --> 00:58:07.955
...really good.

00:58:08.409 --> 00:58:11.982
Everyone kept saying…

00:58:11.982 --> 00:58:14.724
"Her emotional acting is so good. She did amazing."

00:58:15.150 --> 00:58:16.532
Seriously, she was really good. - Thank you.

00:58:16.554 --> 00:58:20.050
At first I was super nervous, but P'Faye really helped me through it.

00:58:20.633 --> 00:58:22.183
That's why the scene turned out well.

00:58:22.183 --> 00:58:24.266
And it was also your first really intense NC scene, right?

00:58:24.575 --> 00:58:25.075
Correct.

00:58:25.075 --> 00:58:26.843
Your first one that emotionally intense like this.

00:58:27.758 --> 00:58:29.394
So I kept telling her, "Hey, don't be scared...

00:58:29.394 --> 00:58:32.391
Everything is carefully protected and planned...

00:58:32.987 --> 00:58:35.387
It's all just acting and...

00:58:35.717 --> 00:58:36.698
Don't worry...

00:58:36.790 --> 00:58:38.763
We will support each other…

00:58:39.268 --> 00:58:42.310
…to make sure everything come out as smoothly and as beautifully as possible."

00:58:43.015 --> 00:58:45.899
And that's it for Episode 5.

00:58:45.899 --> 00:58:48.379
We'll continue with the next reaction, so stay tuned.

00:58:49.223 --> 00:58:51.020
Bye-bye~

